{"id": "f282cf80-256b-4903-992c-99a39d94cb9b", "slug": "aether-spatial-intelligence-engine", "title": "Aether — Spatial Intelligence Engine", "description": "Aether Spatial Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Aether — Spatial Intelligence Engine\"\ndescription: \"Aether Spatial Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#DF5533\"\n  secondary: \"#EFE9D9\"\n  accent: \"#DF4D2A\"\n  background: \"#DF5533\"\n  surface: \"#EFE9D9\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Grotesk\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aether — Spatial Intelligence Engine\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 44; favorites: 3; remixes: 4.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta, bento.\n## Overview\nAether Spatial Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAether v2.4 FEATURES GALLERY WORKBENCH DOWNLOAD ASK AETHER // SPATIAL GENERATION SWAP STEPS FOR STRUCTURAL CODE. GENERATE SPACE IN SECONDS, NOT MONTHS. Aether is the spatial intelligence engine built for developers and…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: SWAP STEPS FOR STRUCTURAL CODE. GENERATE SPACE IN SECONDS, NOT MONTHS.; PROTOTYPE INSTANTLY IN OUR ENGINE; ENGINEERED REALITIES; GLASS VILLA PH-1; MISTY FJORD OBSERVATORY; RING CITY NEXUS.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #DF5533, secondary #EFE9D9, accent #DF4D2A, background #DF5533, surface #EFE9D9, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse JetBrains Mono for display moments and Space Grotesk for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"h-full scroll-smooth\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Aether — Spatial Intelligence Engine</title>\n  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <!-- Iconify Icons -->\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <!-- Google Fonts -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\n    }\n    .mono-font {\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    }\n    /* Custom scrollbar matching the retro tech aesthetic */\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n      width: 6px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n      background: #DF5533;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: #EFE9D9;\n      border-radius: 3px;\n    }\n    /* Dynamic blur-in keyframes */\n    @keyframes blurIn {\n      from {\n        opacity: 0;\n        filter: blur(8px);\n        transform: translateY(12px);\n      }\n      to {\n        opacity: 1;\n        filter: blur(0);\n        transform: translateY(0);\n      }\n    }\n    .animate-blur-in {\n      animation: blurIn 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#DF5533] text-[#EFE9D9] h-full overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#EFE9D9] selection:text-[#DF5533]\">\n\n  <!-- BACKGROUND ISOMETRIC CANVAS (Interactive WebGL/2D Simulation) -->\n  <canvas id=\"isometricCanvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n  <!-- MAIN SCROLLABLE CONTAINER -->\n  <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen\">\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION (Matches Reference Exactly) -->\n    <section class=\"relative w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between p-4 md:p-8\">\n\n      <!-- TOP NAVIGATION BAR -->\n      <header class=\"w-full bg-[#EFE9D9] text-[#DF5533] rounded-lg px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between shadow-xl border border-white/10 animate-blur-in\" style=\"animation-delay: 100ms;\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Aether</span>\n          <span class=\"mono-font text-xs uppercase tracking-widest bg-[#DF5533] text-[#EFE9D9] px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">v2.4</span>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 font-medium text-sm mono-font\">\n          <a href=\"#features\" class=\"hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\">FEATURES</a>\n          <a href=\"#gallery\" class=\"hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\">GALLERY</a>\n          <a href=\"#workbench\" class=\"hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\">WORKBENCH</a>\n        </nav>\n        <div>\n          <a href=\"#download\" class=\"bg-[#DF5533] text-[#EFE9D9] hover:bg-[#c9492a] transition-colors px-5 py-2 rounded text-sm font-semibold mono-font uppercase tracking-wider\">\n            DOWNLOAD\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- OVERLAPPING CAD CARDS (Interactive visual match to reference image) -->\n      <div class=\"relative my-auto max-w-4xl w-full pt-12 pb-24 md:py-0\">\n\n        <!-- CARD LAYER 3 (Back offset) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-transparent border-2 border-[#EFE9D9]/40 rounded-lg translate-x-4 translate-y-4 -z-30 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- CARD LAYER 2 (Middle offset) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-transparent border-2 border-[#EFE9D9]/70 rounded-lg translate-x-2 translate-y-2 -z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- ACTIVE FRONT CARD -->\n        <div class=\"bg-[#DF5533] border-2 border-[#EFE9D9] rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8 shadow-2xl relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-8 animate-blur-in\" style=\"animation-delay: 300ms;\">\n\n          <!-- Card Header Bar -->\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#EFE9D9]/30 pb-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[#EFE9D9] rounded-full animate-pulse\"></span>\n              <span class=\"mono-font text-xs uppercase tracking-widest\">ASK AETHER // SPATIAL GENERATION</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex gap-1.5\">\n              <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-[#EFE9D9]/60\"></span>\n              <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-[#EFE9D9]/60\"></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Main Callout Title -->\n          <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-none uppercase text-[#EFE9D9]\">\n            SWAP STEPS FOR STRUCTURAL CODE. GENERATE SPACE IN SECONDS, NOT MONTHS.\n          </h1>\n\n          <!-- Card Bottom Panel -->\n          <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 pt-4\">\n            <p class=\"max-w-xl text-[#EFE9D9]/90 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed\">\n              Aether is the spatial intelligence engine built for developers and architects who'd rather construct than configure. Draft it, map it, form it — instant generative structure models with complete mathematical integrity.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"shrink-0\">\n              <a href=\"#download\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#EFE9D9] text-[#DF5533] hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 px-6 py-3 rounded text-sm font-semibold mono-font tracking-wider uppercase group shadow-lg\">\n                <span>DOWNLOAD ARCHIVE</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:download-linear\" class=\"text-lg group-hover:translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\" stroke-width=\"2\"></iconify-icon>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- BOTTOM METRIC ROW -->\n      <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-4 border-t border-[#EFE9D9]/20 pt-4 animate-blur-in\" style=\"animation-delay: 500ms;\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 mono-font text-xs text-[#EFE9D9]/80\">\n          <div>LATENCY: <span class=\"text-[#EFE9D9] font-semibold\">14ms</span></div>\n          <div>VERTICES/SEC: <span class=\"text-[#EFE9D9] font-semibold\">4.8M</span></div>\n          <div>STATUS: <span class=\"text-emerald-300 font-semibold animate-pulse\">ONLINE</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mono-font text-xs text-[#EFE9D9]/60\">\n          SECURE ENCRYPTED NODE NETWORK // 2026 AETHER LABS\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- INTERACTIVE WORKBENCH SECTION -->\n    <section id=\"workbench\" class=\"relative py-24 px-4 md:px-8 bg-[#df4d2a] border-t-2 border-[#EFE9D9]/20\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Workspace Control Console -->\n        <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6 reveal-on-scroll\">\n          <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#EFE9D9]/10 border border-[#EFE9D9]/20 rounded-full px-3 py-1 self-start\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"mono-font text-xs uppercase tracking-wider\">Interactive Terminal</span>\n          </div>\n          <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight\">\n            PROTOTYPE INSTANTLY IN OUR ENGINE\n          </h2>\n          <p class=\"text-[#EFE9D9]/80 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed\">\n            Manipulate parametric variables and watch as structural configurations resolve directly inside our topological solver. Ensure geometric compliance instantly.\n          </p>\n\n          <!-- Interactive Sliders (Custom Designed UI) -->\n          <div class=\"bg-[#DF5533]/80 border border-[#EFE9D9]/30 rounded-lg p-5 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs mono-font mb-2\">\n                <span>GRID RESOLUTION</span>\n                <span id=\"resVal\">32x32</span>\n              </div>\n              <input type=\"range\" id=\"resSlider\" min=\"8\" max=\"64\" value=\"32\" class=\"w-full accent-[#EFE9D9] bg-[#df4d2a] rounded-lg appearance-none h-1 cursor-pointer\">\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs mono-font mb-2\">\n                <span>TENSION THRESHOLD</span>\n                <span id=\"tensionVal\">0.45</span>\n              </div>\n              <input type=\"range\" id=\"tensionSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.45\" class=\"w-full accent-[#EFE9D9] bg-[#df4d2a] rounded-lg appearance-none h-1 cursor-pointer\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center pt-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-xs mono-font\">GEOMETRY: TRIAXIAL</span>\n              <button onclick=\"toggleGeometry()\" class=\"bg-[#EFE9D9] text-[#DF5533] hover:opacity-90 transition-all text-xs mono-font px-3 py-1.5 rounded font-semibold uppercase\">\n                TOGGLE TYPE\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Simulated Workspace Canvas Render -->\n        <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 reveal-on-scroll\">\n          <div class=\"relative bg-[#EFE9D9] text-[#DF5533] rounded-lg p-4 shadow-2xl border border-white/20\">\n            <!-- Header bar of CAD window -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#DF5533]/20 pb-3 mb-4\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:globus-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"mono-font text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">RENDER_VIEWPORT::ACTIVE</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex gap-1\">\n                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#DF5533]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#DF5533]/40\"></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Visual Content (Using high-quality futuristic isometric architecture render from Aura database) -->\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-video rounded overflow-hidden group border border-[#DF5533]/20 bg-[#DF5533]/5\">\n              <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779238869294-62ef3e5f-8ba3-44f8-8355-53ffb9deb402.png\" alt=\"Futuristic Deconstructed Pyramid Render\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover filter contrast-125 saturate-50 mix-blend-multiply opacity-90 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779238869294-62ef3e5f-8ba3-44f8-8355-53ffb9deb402.png\">\n\n              <!-- Subtle overlay interface grid -->\n              <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#DF5533]/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n              <div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 bg-[#DF5533] text-[#EFE9D9] mono-font text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded\">\n                FRAME_RATE: 120FPS\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer statistics -->\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mt-4 text-[11px] mono-font opacity-80\">\n              <span>NODES: 2,401</span>\n              <span>POLYGONS: 4,800</span>\n              <span>RENDER: PATH_TRACED</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ARCHITECTURAL SHOWCASE SECTION (Premium Grid + Aura Images) -->\n    <section id=\"gallery\" class=\"py-24 px-4 md:px-8 bg-[#DF5533] border-t-2 border-[#EFE9D9]/20\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-6 mb-16 reveal-on-scroll\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#EFE9D9]/10 border border-[#EFE9D9]/20 rounded-full px-3 py-1 mb-4\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:gallery-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n              <span class=\"mono-font text-xs uppercase tracking-wider\">Sought Horizons</span>\n            </div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">ENGINEERED REALITIES</h2>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"max-w-md text-[#EFE9D9]/80 text-sm md:text-base\">\n            Explore structural frameworks generated by our user community. High-fidelity architectural designs calculated instantly with Aether's topological constraint engines.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Premium Grid with Gradients -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n\n          <!-- Card 1 -->\n          <div class=\"group relative rounded-lg p-1 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#EFE9D9]/20 to-transparent hover:from-[#EFE9D9]/40 transition-all duration-500 reveal-on-scroll\">\n            <div class=\"bg-[#df4d2a] p-4 rounded-lg flex flex-col gap-4\">\n              <div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] rounded overflow-hidden\">\n                <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779238894297-dd3c2841-8399-4aee-ba12-6b0072fc4cb7.png\" alt=\"Modern glass villa at dusk\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover filter saturate-75 contrast-110 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779238894297-dd3c2841-8399-4aee-ba12-6b0072fc4cb7.png\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                <div>\n                  <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-[#EFE9D9]\">GLASS VILLA PH-1</h3>\n                  <span class=\"mono-font text-xs text-[#EFE9D9]/60\">VALENCIA, SPAIN</span>\n                </div>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-xl group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 2 -->\n          <div class=\"group relative rounded-lg p-1 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#EFE9D9]/20 to-transparent hover:from-[#EFE9D9]/40 transition-all duration-500 reveal-on-scroll\" style=\"animation-delay: 150ms;\">\n            <div class=\"bg-[#df4d2a] p-4 rounded-lg flex flex-col gap-4\">\n              <div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] rounded overflow-hidden\">\n                <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779238921235-1d75eca6-0d15-4efb-a855-636cbed4d1d7.png\" alt=\"Minimalist glass office\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover filter saturate-75 contrast-110 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779238921235-1d75eca6-0d15-4efb-a855-636cbed4d1d7.png\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                <div>\n                  <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-[#EFE9D9]\">MISTY FJORD OBSERVATORY</h3>\n                  <span class=\"mono-font text-xs text-[#EFE9D9]/60\">NORDLAND, NORWAY</span>\n                </div>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-xl group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 3 -->\n          <div class=\"group relative rounded-lg p-1 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#EFE9D9]/20 to-transparent hover:from-[#EFE9D9]/40 transition-all duration-500 reveal-on-scroll\" style=\"animation-delay: 300ms;\">\n            <div class=\"bg-[#df4d2a] p-4 rounded-lg flex flex-col gap-4\">\n              <div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] rounded overflow-hidden\">\n                <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779238947579-12735c21-0b69-4631-ab9e-32212dc9d010.png\" alt=\"Ring-Shaped Futuristic City\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover filter saturate-75 contrast-110 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779238947579-12735c21-0b69-4631-ab9e-32212dc9d010.png\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                <div>\n                  <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg text-[#EFE9D9]\">RING CITY NEXUS</h3>\n                  <span class=\"mono-font text-xs text-[#EFE9D9]/60\">NEOM, SAUDI ARABIA</span>\n                </div>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-xl group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- CORE FEATURES GRID -->\n    <section id=\"features\" class=\"py-24 px-4 md:px-8 bg-[#df4d2a] border-t-2 border-[#EFE9D9]/20\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal-on-scroll\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase\">System Capability</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-[#EFE9D9]/80 mt-4 text-sm md:text-base\">Built to handle dense vector maps, complex parametric variations, and instantaneous export pathways.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n\n          <!-- Feature item -->\n          <div class=\"border border-[#EFE9D9]/30 rounded-lg p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 bg-[#DF5533]/40 reveal-on-scroll\">\n            <div class=\"text-[#EFE9D9]\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" class=\"text-3xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg uppercase\">Sub-layering Solves</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-[#EFE9D9]/80 leading-relaxed\">\n              Dynamically layer node networks to create highly intricate architectural models without system degradation.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Feature item -->\n          <div class=\"border border-[#EFE9D9]/30 rounded-lg p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 bg-[#DF5533]/40 reveal-on-scroll\" style=\"animation-delay: 100ms;\">\n            <div class=\"text-[#EFE9D9]\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-3xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg uppercase\">Local GPU Solvers</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-[#EFE9D9]/80 leading-relaxed\">\n              No cloud delays. Generate models using local machine acceleration via low-level execution architecture.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Feature item -->\n          <div class=\"border border-[#EFE9D9]/30 rounded-lg p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 bg-[#DF5533]/40 reveal-on-scroll\" style=\"animation-delay: 200ms;\">\n            <div class=\"text-[#EFE9D9]\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:export-linear\" class=\"text-3xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg uppercase\">Dynamic Exports</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-[#EFE9D9]/80 leading-relaxed\">\n              Instantly output models directly to standard industry-ready CAD extensions such as STEP, OBJ, or DXF.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Feature item -->\n          <div class=\"border border-[#EFE9D9]/30 rounded-lg p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 bg-[#DF5533]/40 reveal-on-scroll\" style=\"animation-delay: 300ms;\">\n            <div class=\"text-[#EFE9D9]\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" class=\"text-3xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg uppercase\">Zero Data Locks</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-[#EFE9D9]/80 leading-relaxed\">\n              Keep your proprietary configurations safe. Your generated topologies are private, stored entirely on your disk.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- TESTIMONIAL PANEL -->\n    <section class=\"py-24 px-4 md:px-8 bg-[#DF5533] border-t-2 border-[#EFE9D9]/20\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-8 reveal-on-scroll\">\n        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:quotes-linear\" class=\"text-5xl opacity-40\"></iconify-icon>\n        <blockquote class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-relaxed italic\">\n          \"Aether allowed our design firm to skip weeks of tedious manual drawing and go straight to structural modeling. It's completely rewritten how we conceptualize environments.\"\n        </blockquote>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/c92852bb-a510-405a-85ab-ffa0fde136a4_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Professional portrait\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-[#EFE9D9]\">\n          <div class=\"text-left\">\n            <div class=\"font-bold text-sm uppercase\">Marcus Aurel</div>\n            <div class=\"mono-font text-xs text-[#EFE9D9]/70\">Principal Architect, Continuum Studio</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- DOWNLOAD / FOOTER CALLOUT -->\n    <section id=\"download\" class=\"py-32 px-4 md:px-8 bg-[#df4d2a] border-t-2 border-[#EFE9D9]/20 relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n      <!-- Gradient borders visual enhancement -->\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-black/20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-8 reveal-on-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase leading-none\">\n          READY TO SHIFT CONFIGURATIONS?\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"max-w-xl text-sm md:text-base text-[#EFE9D9]/90\">\n          Get started with Aether today. Available for Windows, macOS, and Linux kernels. Enjoy raw performance directly out of the box.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full justify-center\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-[#EFE9D9] text-[#DF5533] hover:bg-white transition-colors duration-300 px-8 py-4 rounded font-semibold text-sm mono-font uppercase tracking-wider shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:download-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n            DOWNLOAD FOR DESKTOP\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"border-2 border-[#EFE9D9] hover:bg-[#EFE9D9] hover:text-[#DF5533] transition-colors duration-300 px-8 py-4 rounded font-semibold text-sm mono-font uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n            DOCUMENTATION\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 pt-8 text-[#EFE9D9]/60 text-xs mono-font\">\n          <span>CURRENT STABLE: v2.4.1</span>\n          <span>•</span>\n          <span>COMPATIBLE WITH BLENDER / REVIT / RHINO</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#DF5533] text-[#EFE9D9]/80 py-8 px-4 md:px-8 border-t border-[#EFE9D9]/20\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-lg text-[#EFE9D9]\">Aether</span>\n          <span class=\"text-xs opacity-60\">© 2026 Aether Labs Inc. All rights reserved.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-6 text-xs mono-font\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:underline\">PRIVACY POLICY</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:underline\">TERMS OF USE</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:underline\">SECURITY STATUS</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- INTERACTIVE CANVAS & INTERACTIVE SLIDERS JAVASCRIPT -->\n  <script>\n    // Canvas Isometric grid setup\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('isometricCanvas');\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n    let width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n    let height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n\n    let points = [];\n    const spacingX = 60;\n    const spacingY = 35;\n    let mouse = { x: null, y: null, radius: 150 };\n\n    window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n      width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n      height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n      initGrid();\n    });\n\n    window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n      mouse.x = e.clientX;\n      mouse.y = e.clientY;\n    });\n\n    window.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n      mouse.x = null;\n      mouse.y = null;\n    });\n\n    class GridPoint {\n      constructor(x, y, row, col) {\n        this.baseX = x;\n        this.baseY = y;\n        this.x = x;\n        this.y = y;\n        this.row = row;\n        this.col = col;\n        this.angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n        this.pulseSpeed = 0.02 + Math.random() * 0.03;\n      }\n\n      update() {\n        // Natural pulsing motion\n        this.angle += this.pulseSpeed;\n        let offset = Math.sin(this.angle) * 3;\n\n        // Mouse interaction displacement\n        if (mouse.x !== null && mouse.y !== null) {\n          let dx = mouse.x - this.baseX;\n          let dy = mouse.y - this.baseY;\n          let dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n          if (dist < mouse.radius) {\n            let force = (mouse.radius - dist) / mouse.radius;\n            this.x = this.baseX - dx * force * 0.15;\n            this.y = this.baseY - dy * force * 0.15 + offset;\n            return;\n          }\n        }\n\n        this.x = this.baseX;\n        this.y = this.baseY + offset;\n      }\n    }\n\n    function initGrid() {\n      points = [];\n      let rows = Math.ceil(height / spacingY) + 4;\n      let cols = Math.ceil(width / spacingX) + 4;\n\n      for (let r = -2; r < rows; r++) {\n        for (let c = -2; c < cols; c++) {\n          let x = c * spacingX;\n          if (r % 2 === 0) {\n            x += spacingX / 2;\n          }\n          let y = r * spacingY;\n          points.push(new GridPoint(x, y, r, c));\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    function animate() {\n      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n      // Update positions\n      points.forEach(p => p.update());\n\n      // Draw Connection Lines (Triangular Isometric pattern)\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(239, 233, 217, 0.15)';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 0.8;\n\n      for (let i = 0; i < points.length; i++) {\n        let p1 = points[i];\n\n        for (let j = i + 1; j < points.length; j++) {\n          let p2 = points[j];\n          let dx = p1.x - p2.x;\n          let dy = p1.y - p2.y;\n          let dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n          // Connect horizontal and diagonal neighbors\n          if (dist < spacingX * 1.2) {\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(p1.x, p1.y);\n            ctx.lineTo(p2.x, p2.y);\n            ctx.stroke();\n          }\n        }\n      }\n\n      // Draw intersections/dots\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(239, 233, 217, 0.3)';\n      points.forEach(p => {\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, 1.8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.fill();\n      });\n\n      requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n    }\n\n    initGrid();\n    animate();\n\n    // INTERACTIVE CONTROLS\n    const resSlider = document.getElementById('resSlider');\n    const resVal = document.getElementById('resVal');\n    const tensionSlider = document.getElementById('tensionSlider');\n    const tensionVal = document.getElementById('tensionVal');\n\n    resSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n      resVal.textContent = `${e.target.value}x${e.target.value}`;\n    });\n\n    tensionSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n      tensionVal.textContent = parseFloat(e.target.value).toFixed(2);\n    });\n\n    function toggleGeometry() {\n      alert(\"Geometric solver format toggled: Hexagonal lattice configuration optimized.\");\n    }\n\n    // INTERSECTION OBSERVER FOR TRIGGERED ANIMATIONS\n    const observerOptions = {\n      root: null,\n      rootMargin: '0px',\n      threshold: 0.1\n    };\n\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n      entries.forEach(entry => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          entry.target.classList.add('animate-blur-in');\n          entry.target.classList.remove('opacity-0');\n          observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n        }\n      });\n    }, observerOptions);\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-on-scroll').forEach(el => {\n      el.classList.add('opacity-0');\n      observer.observe(el);\n    });\n  </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "aether-spatial-intelligence-engine.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aether-spatial-intelligence-engine.jpg", "source_name": "aether-spatial-intelligence-engine-DESIGN.md", "views": 94, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T02:02:30.215881+00:00"}